{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04347","headline":"巫山怀古 · 刘希夷","name":"巫山怀古","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"巫山幽阴地，神女艳阳年。\n襄王伺容色，落日望悠然。\n归来高唐夜，金釭焰青烟。\n颓想卧瑶席，梦魂何翩翩。\n摇落殊未已，荣华倏徂迁。\n愁思潇湘浦，悲凉云梦田。\n猿啼秋风夜，鴈飞明月天。\n巴歌不可听，听此益潺湲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘希夷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04347.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04347","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}